<p>BitJR Academy and Space is a non-profit Bitcoin initiative focused on educating kids ages 6–17 and building a kids’ Bitcoin circular economy. We are based in Livingstone, Zambia. Our two priorities are Bitcoin education and a safe environment where kids can earn, spend, and save sats.</p>

