<h2>Our Vision</h2>
<p>To prepare children for the future by using Bitcoin to build financial confidence, creativity, and independence.</p>

<h2>Why We Do It</h2>
<p>Many children lack guidance on Bitcoin. Kids are naturally innovative and creative, and Bitcoin offers a path to financial independence. A young population is ready to learn and adapt when given the right tools.</p>

<h2>Problems We Are Addressing</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Kids don’t have access to bank or mobile money services.</li>
  <li>Teaching healthy saving habits early.</li>
  <li>Opening minds to the global economy through borderless money.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Our Strategy</h2>
<p>We use Bitcoin education, games, NFC Bolt cards, and real transactions to drive adoption in Livingstone, Zambia.</p>

<h2>Our Challenges in 2025</h2>
<ul>
  <li>No permanent learning space.</li>
  <li>No long-term reliable way of earning sats.</li>
  <li>No reliable mode of transport for kids to and from classes, meetups, and merchants.</li>
  <li>No reliable way to get NFC Bolt cards.</li>
  <li>Most kids don’t have smart devices, which hinders Bitcoin transaction practice.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Our Achievements in 2025</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Taught 100 kids ages 6–17.</li>
  <li>Onboarded 2 local school tuck shops.</li>
  <li>Taught 18 local school teachers.</li>
  <li>15 kids now spend Bitcoin daily.</li>
</ul>



